'''Raw guanic bat (0)''' is obtained by from catching [[guanic bat]]s within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Raw guanic bats require level 1 in Hunter to catch and grants the player 5 [[experience]] when caught.

They are cooked with a [[Cooking]] level of 1 to produce [[guanic bat (0)]], granting 10 experience in Cooking.

